    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000st95](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000st95) Magnitude 6.7 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Jun 16 2026 34km S of Parigi. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -1.1173 longitude 120.199. It impacted 636265 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
